<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Showcase: Queen Elizabeth</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;UK and Coalition Forcess v China&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&amp;nbsp;6th October,&amp;nbsp;2021 / 01:00:00 Zulu&lt;BR&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Location:&lt;/STRONG&gt; South China Sea&lt;BR&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Duration:&lt;/STRONG&gt; 1 Day 6 Hours&lt;BR&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable Sides:&lt;/STRONG&gt; UK and Coalition Forces&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;It was no secret that relations between the United Kingdom and China had soured over recent years. Already strained over issues such as Hong Kong, the countries’ links have suffered greatly during the Covid Pandemic.&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Such issues have prompted London to reassess its relationship with Beijing, with the decision to deny Huawei an active role in Britain’s 5G Network heralding a more confrontational approach to bilateral affairs.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;British Military presence remains notable throughout the regional infrastructure with a Royal Navy “presence” in Singapore complementing a more conventional base in Brunei.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;China has issued a warning to the United Kingdom that its Carrier Strike Group is not to carry out any "improper acts" when they enter the South China Sea.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The People's Liberation Army Navy is reported to be at a high state of combat readiness with two CVBGs's deployed to the region, with other units monitoring the progress of the UK Strike Group, which is currently conducting FONOPS&amp;nbsp;in the South China Sea&amp;nbsp;before sailing&amp;nbsp;to Singapore.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Scenario Author&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;The Stig.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
